docs {
  # MTN Momo Pay Disbursements API Collection
  
  ## Overview
  Use this collection as a guide for understanding and interacting with MTN for facilitating mobile money transactions: specifically disbursements. 
  
  Disbursement is the action that describes the MCF transfering funds from their MTN Wallet to a Beneficiary (in the case of Kind Giving App.) or to a Borrower (in the case of the Kind Loans App.)
  
  ## Variables
  Ensure to use the correct variables which you can get by perusing the MTN Momo Pay Docs and registering for a developer account. As it stands, the variables used in this collection are associated with a maintainers MTN Developer account. 
  
  ## Resources
  [Disbursements MTN Momo Pay Resources](https://momodeveloper.mtn.com/api-details#api=disbursement&operation=GetTransferStatus)
  
  ## Questions
  Please reach out to @Ayo on Slack if you have any questions.
}
